# warnings

## DEPRECATED_IMPORT_ASSERTION

```text
[DEPRECATED_IMPORT_ASSERTION] The legacy `assert` keyword in "main.js" is deprecated and is treated as `with`. Use `with` instead.
    ╭─[ main.js:10:24 ]
    │
 10 │   import('./dep.js', { assert: { kind: 'x' } }),
    │                        ───┬──  
    │                           ╰──── replace `assert` with `with`
────╯

```

