## INVALID_IMPORT_ATTRIBUTE

```text
[INVALID_IMPORT_ATTRIBUTE] Rolldown could not statically analyze an import attribute of a dynamic import in "main.js". Import attributes need to have string keys and values, so the attribute is ignored.
   ╭─[ main.js:9:43 ]
   │
 9 │   import('./dep.js', { with: { kind: 'x', [key]: 'y', size: 1 } }),
   │                                           ─────┬────  
   │                                                ╰────── not a string key and value
───╯

```

