## INVALID_IMPORT_ATTRIBUTE

```text
[INVALID_IMPORT_ATTRIBUTE] Rolldown could not statically analyze the options of a dynamic import in "main.js". Dynamic import options need to be an object with a nested `with` object, so the import has no attributes.
